        # Rook captured on its original square
        if to_sq == "a1":
            castling = castling.replace("Q", "")
        elif to_sq == "h1":
            castling = castling.replace("K", "")
        elif to_sq == "a8":
            castling = castling.replace("Q", "")
        elif to_sq == "h8":
            castling = castling.replace("q", "")
        if not castling:
            castling = "-"
```

Note: capture on a8 → remove the black queen-side 'Q'. Also capture on h1 → 'K'.

